sequenceDiagram
  participant D as Bunny Desktop
  participant R as Broker socket
  participant S as Fixed backend
  D->>R: contract 1.0.0 request + nonce
  R->>R: schema/authz/replay/rate checks
  R->>S: allowlisted method + validated values
  S->>S: absolute executable + fixed argv/env/timeout
  S-->>R: bounded typed result
  R-->>D: response with same request ID

